		{"id":"notes","type":"text","text":"## Not yet decided — do not assume\n\n1. **Auth's exact role** — API gateway that proxies everything, or login-only with clients calling modules directly?\n2. **Where identity lives** — one shared account store for all tenants, or per-tenant? (\"1 person = 1 account\" points to shared)\n3. **Inter-service communication** — REST · gRPC · messaging\n4. **Tenant resolution** — subdomain · JWT claim · header\n5. **Transactions across services** — donations touch several modules\n6. **MySQL → PostgreSQL migration** — cutover or strangler fig\n7. **Orchestration** — Compose · ECS · EKS\n8. Module list beyond the four named","x":1340,"y":-630,"width":400,"height":400,"color":"3"},
